                           aims/verify/fip.rs lines 75-200;
                           `FipVerificationError` wrap to
                           `VerifyError::FipStructural` at
                           pipeline/aims_pipeline/mod.rs line
                           269 (first-pass) + batch.rs line
                           231 (second-pass batch);
                           interprocedural extraction
                           initializes provisional Never seed
                           at compiler/ori_arc/
                           src/aims/interprocedural/extract.rs
      cross-language Koka Perceus
      prior art: (`koka/src/Core/CheckFBIP.hs`)
                           certifies FIP / FBIP at function
                           level via similar post-realization
                           verification — alloc count + dealloc
                           count post-Reset/Reuse emission;
                           Lean 4 `lean4/src/Lean/Compiler/IR/`
                           tracks reuse opportunities via
